<p>
Our Corporate Communications team provides the latest information on news, events, awards, and industry news related
to Austin Energy.
</p>
<h3>
Online Resources
</h3>
<ul>
    <li>
    <a href="/about/news/news-releases" target="_self" title="News Releases">News
    Releases</a>
    </li>
    <li>
    <a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://coautilities.com/wps/wcm/connect/occ/coa/util/news/aun" target="_blank" title="Austin Utilities Now Monthly Newsletter">Austin Utilities Now</a>
    </li>
</ul>
<h3>
Also of Interest
</h3>
<ul>
    <li>
    <a href="/about/company-profile" target="_self" title="Company Profile">Who We Are</a>
    </li>
    <li>
    <a href="/about/reports">Corporate Reports</a>&nbsp;  </li>
    <li>
    <a href="/about/community-outreach" target="_self" title="Community Outreach">Community Outreach</a>
    </li>
</ul>
<h3>
Media Requests
</h3>
<p>
Our Corporate Communications team is available to assist with all media requests:
</p>
<ul>
    <li>Interviews&nbsp;</li>
    <li>Facts, statistics
    </li>
    <li>Background information
    </li>
</ul>
<p>
Staff is available around-the-clock to answer utility questions.
</p>
<p>
For more information, contact:
</p>
<p>
Austin Energy Corporate Communications<br />
Phone: 512-322-6514<br />
Email: <a href="mailto:communications@austinenergy.com?Subject=Media%20Request">Media Request</a>
</p>
<h3>
Request Public Information
</h3>
<p>
You can request public information pertaining to Austin Energy or any City or Austin Department.
</p>
<p>
All requests go through Austin Communications and Engagement via their online public information
request form.
</p>
<p>
<a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.austintexas.gov/services/submit-public-information-request" target="_blank" title="Submit a Public Information Request">Submit a public information request</a>
</p>        </div>
    </div>


